[TEST] Please perform and report:  
- Observation for abnormal involuntary movements (e.g., chorea, grimacing, repetitive gestures) or catatonic signs (e.g., posturing, waxy flexibility, mutism);  
- Assessment of ocular motility (smooth pursuit, saccades) and presence of nystagmus or opsoclonus;  
- Gait and balance (tandem walk if safe).

[THOUGHT continues] This targeted neuro exam will help rule in/out treatable neurological mimics before proceeding to lab/imaging.

